cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "NKG7 mini-binder design pipeline"
message: "If you use this pipeline, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Corvino
    given-names: Dillon
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0683-1369"
    website: "https://dilloncorvino.com"
abstract: >-
  Config-driven de novo mini-binder design pipeline (RFdiffusion, ProteinMPNN, Boltz-2,
  Chai-1 consensus, cross-species testing) applied to the extracellular loops of human and
  mouse NKG7, with a sequence-complexity audit of the designed binders.
repository-code: "https://github.com/Eomesodermin/nkg7-binder-design"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - de novo protein design
  - mini-binder
  - RFdiffusion
  - ProteinMPNN
  - Boltz-2
  - NKG7
